  <!-- EN: long-range cannon -->
  <DMSE_Turret_Empero.label>遠程加農砲</DMSE_Turret_Empero.label>
  <!-- EN: The NK-30 "Empero" is a heavy long-range cannon with an extremely high muzzle velocity. It shells distant targets with precision, suppressing enemy fire and destroying installations. At close range it fires reduced charges at low velocity for plunging fire, still with very high accuracy. When shelling a target on the world map, it keeps firing until stopped or out of power, pausing while it waits for a shell or a new barrel.\n\nThe gun has no crew: it fires whatever mortar shell is loaded, at local targets and on the world map. A linked shell autoloader loads one shell at a time from its own stock; set the allowed shell types on the gun's shells tab. Each shot wears the barrel, which colonists replace with a reinforced barrel when it is worn out.\n\nUnguided shells scatter widely at long range and only land near the middle of the target area. If a fire-control radar that supports artillery guidance has a free channel when the gun fires, the shell is radar-guided onto enemy turrets, powered buildings or people in the area, and lands much closer to them. Each guided shell holds one channel for a while.\n\nFire mode toggle: ranging shells scatter around the middle of the target area and log each impact; fire for effect shells scatter around the last logged impact on that map (every friendly gun shelling it shares that point) and tighten their scatter by a quarter of the base scatter per shot.\n\nCannot strike targets in high orbit across layers. -->
  <DMSE_Turret_Empero.description>NK-30 "帝王"是一種砲口初速極高的重型遠程加農砲，能夠精確砲擊遠程目標來極大壓制敵方火力及摧毀設施，在近距離發射時下會使用減裝彈藥來透過低初速進行曲射，但仍有極高的精度。在砲擊世界地圖目標時會持續射擊直到下令停止或斷電，等待裝彈或換管時會暫停。

此砲不需砲手：裝填哪一種迫擊砲彈，本地與世界地圖打出去就是哪一種。連結的自動裝填架會從架上的存彈逐發裝填，可在砲塔的「砲彈」頁設定允許的彈種。每次發射都會磨耗砲管，耗盡後由殖民者更換強化砲管。

無導引的砲彈在遠距離散佈極大，只會落在目標區域中央附近。開火時若有支援砲擊引導的火控雷達空出通道，就能夠由雷達導引瞄準該區域的敵方砲塔、用電設備或人員，落點也近得多。每發導引砲彈會佔用一條通道一段時間。

無法跨層砲擊高空軌道目標。</DMSE_Turret_Empero.description>
  <!-- EN: Barrel durability -->
  <DMSE_Turret_Empero.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>砲管耐久</DMSE_Turret_Empero.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Shots until barrel change -->
  <DMSE_Turret_Empero.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>換管前可射擊次數</DMSE_Turret_Empero.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Needs new reinforced barrel -->
  <DMSE_Turret_Empero.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>需要新的強化砲管</DMSE_Turret_Empero.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: shell autoloader -->
  <DMSE_ShellAutoloader.label>自動裝填架</DMSE_ShellAutoloader.label>
  <!-- EN: A powered ammunition rack that feeds mortar shells into linked guns that have no crew, such as the long-range cannon. Colonists stock it like a shelf; whenever a linked gun is empty, it loads one shell of a type the gun's shells tab allows. It stops loading without power. -->
  <DMSE_ShellAutoloader.description>通電的彈藥架，替連結且不需砲手的火砲（例如遠程加農砲）裝填迫擊砲彈。殖民者會像存放到貨架一樣把砲彈搬到這裡；連結的砲空膛時，就從架上裝填一發該砲「砲彈」頁允許的砲彈。斷電時停止裝填。</DMSE_ShellAutoloader.description>
  
</LanguageData>